&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Join New Era Technology, where People First is at the heart of everything we do. With a global team of over 3,000 professionals, we&#39;re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels valued, empowered, and inspired to grow. Our mission is to securely connect people, places, and information with end-to-end technology solutions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At New Era, you&#39;ll join a team-oriented culture that prioritizes your personal and professional development. Work alongside industry-certified experts, access continuous training, and enjoy competitive benefits. Guided by our core attributes — putting people first, embracing continuous learning, and thriving through collaboration and inclusion — we nurture our people to deliver exceptional customer service.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;If you want to make an impact in a supportive, growth-oriented environment, New Era is the place for you. Apply today and help us shape the future of work—together&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous and quality driven on-boarding process taking 3 months before sign-off to serve independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pro-active actions to ensure SLAs and KPIs are achieved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular documented and communicated updates with clear status, descriptions and actions in Service Now and Jira applications plus others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incidents and Change form part of daily activities and need to be carefully and accurately worked on towards a successful quality closure following predefined steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation of Changes following precise steps, testing, communication and documentation towards a successful closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entry into Service (EiS) activities assisting colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project implementation assisting colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitoring and alerts happen daily where knowledge and response skills are required to ensure quick actions are taken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalation to colleagues and peers, if in doubt without, to seek advice and guidance is encouraged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reviewing and Updating documentation in tools like Confluence are a key element to follow with diligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipment Installation, configuration, implementation and de-commissioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting to ‘make good’ and ‘tidy up’ works to deliver a final customer facing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting stock management and inventory updates are regular activities and need due diligence and accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adherence to all H&amp;amp;S requirements at site(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross country involvement with colleagues outside of the UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation and contribution in Google, MS Teams (and others) plus Customer facing meetings when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Duty in a rota of 1 in 3 weeks over a 7-day week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to provide input on areas that can be improved for individual and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other Job Specifications:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The candidate will undergo detailed vetting to gain security clearance (SC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The environment is heavy aircraft manufacturing operations with high quality,strong culture and significant safety on a global basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work overtime, shift patterns and on-call in a rota system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 x 8-hour shift patterns commencing on site at 06:00am and 10:00am M-F and a work from home shift commencing at 08:00am which can be flexible with agreement. 30-minute break each shift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The need to be less than one hour away from site for any On Call emergency activity to be carried out at site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to be a lone worker on site following the agreed site communications and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven technical skills in technologies like Cisco, Aruba, Arista, F5, Cabling and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in pan-European technical expertise, forums, collaborations and escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to share and gain knowledge with team members and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protocols IPv4, IPv6, TCP, UDP, DNS, DHCP, BGP, OSPF&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IOS, VPN, Routing, Firewall, Google, Microsoft, Cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Network cabling, copper, fibre, wireless, telephony can be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soft skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer satisfaction oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team member and spirit priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conscientious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presentable and well mannered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tidy and proud of workmanship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;General background:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3 years’ experience in multi-site managed service network environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manufacturing 24 x 365 campus environment advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in shift patterns and on-call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full UK driving licence (clean is desired).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vetting will be a requirement and must be successful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sick pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work authorisation:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;United Kingdom (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;New Era Technology, LLC., and its subsidiaries (“New Era” “we”, “us”, or “our”) in its operating regions worldwide are committed to respecting your privacy and recognize the need for appropriate protection and management of any Personal Data that you may provide us. In this, we are also committed to providing you with a positive experience on our websites and while using our products, services and solutions (“Solutions”).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;View our Privacy Policy here &lt;a id=&quot;menur1e55&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.neweratech.com/us/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;menur1e57&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.neweratech.com/us/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.neweratech.com/us/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We never ask candidates to pay any fees at any point in our hiring process. If you are ever asked to provide payment for training, certification, equipment, or any other purpose, it is not from our company. Only communications from our official company channels should be trusted. Please note our official email domain is ----- If you suspect fraudulent activity, please contact us immediately at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- .&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Senior Project Manager and Release Manager needed to join our Delivery Team on a contractual basis.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Senior Project Manager, with a technical background, who has experience managing technical teams and releases across complex client environments. You encourage strong relationships with your team and have the ability the talk, at a technical level, with developers and senior technical team members (e.g., technical architects, solution architects etc). You follow best practices in development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development principals and CI/CD.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please bear in mind that this is a contractual role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release and technical reporting regarding project/account technical deliverables, architecture and release pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical risks and issues &amp;amp; provide mitigation options to achieve resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeably communicate with stakeholders (internal/external) including chairing technical meetings as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and co-ordinate Internal technical specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire the team to achieve individual and team objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the technical team(s) complete what is expected of them successfully and suggest improvements to processes as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support to Junior Technical Project Managers within your account or across WTC&amp;amp;T giving them regular constructive feedback to help with their development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, plan, organise and manage the build of new infrastructure environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-ordinate high quality technical solutions, on time, via effective time management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with emerging industry practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively run complex projects using Agile or Waterfall methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee releases across pre-production and production environments, demonstrating an understanding of dependencies between client systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement technical governance according to the client’s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer confidence by understanding their needs &amp;amp; delivering first class solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and manage client expectations, addressing issues in a respectful and timely manner and ensuring the organisation maintains a positive image and provides a high-quality service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage 3rd party product vendors, environments, and client technical resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management experience, and ecommerce experience ideally within a retail environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read log files, draw conclusions and direct further technical investigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with eCommerce frameworks and hosting solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud/on prem. Infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Azure and AWS DevOps Tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining, managing and delivering to customer expectations within strict deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full knowledge of the project lifecycle and experience of various project development methodologies (including Agile, Incremental and Waterfall)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with complex technical environments and legacy systems integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing 3rd parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong time management &amp;amp; organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation skills and an ability to handle sensitive issues with tact and diplomacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Project Management qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Microsoft Office Packages, especially MS Excel and MS PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;If you have some of this, even better&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree with a major in information management, marketing, communications, business or other closely-related areas is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A developer background or programming qualification is advantageous but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Jenkins or other release pipeline tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of code management tools such as git, bit bucket, svn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A basic understanding of Terraform - at a level you can engage with technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
