&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Accessibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: which is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people from all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to offering an inclusive and accessible selection process to all candidates. Should you require any accommodations, you can request them via the application form, and your request will remain confidential. These requests do not affect the outcome of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all. Fulfilling this mission requires design excellence at both ends of our digital experience: for the millions of sports lovers using our customer apps and websites, and for the thousands of teammates who rely on our tools in stores, warehouses, and offices to do their jobs every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital design plays a pivotal role in supporting Decathlon’s growth and human connection. How? By ensuring our digital tools are simple, reliable, and enjoyable, and by giving our design community the shared foundations, systems, and practices they need to deliver the best possible experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Design Senior Manager &lt;/strong&gt;within the Product Center of Excellence (CoE) to lead our core design capabilities, provide thought leadership on the future of our craft, and support our design community across Decathlon Digital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Design Leader, you will have a dual mission: you will directly manage the Design System team and the Design &amp;amp; Research Ops team, while functionally leading and inspiring the community of digital product designers embedded across our different business domains (eCommerce, Store apps, Supply Chain, and internal platforms) and countries. You will also steer how design evolves at Decathlon in the era of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Digital Design Leader, you will act as a strategic partner at Decathlon Digital to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and develop your direct teams &lt;/strong&gt;(Design System and Design &amp;amp; Research Ops): set their priorities, support their professional growth, and ensure their work delivers tangible value to Decathlon teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead our Design System&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure its relevance across all digital touchpoints by catering to the specific needs of B2C, E2E, and B2B products, as well as sports experiences. Measure its adoption and its contribution to team efficiency and experience quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Design &amp;amp; Research Ops&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure that tools, methods, and operational frameworks meet real team needs, are effectively adopted, and tangibly contribute to operational efficiency and the quality of product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support and coach our design teammates functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; clarify career paths, structure onboarding programs, drive upskilling, and foster synergies and best-practice sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion a forward-looking vision for design and its practices&lt;/strong&gt;, especially in the era of AI, through active industry monitoring and experimentation with emerging practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create the conditions for active community contribution &lt;/strong&gt;to the evolution of our tools, standards, and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong partnerships with Product and Engineering leaders&lt;/strong&gt; to advocate for design excellence, digital accessibility (RGAA / WCAG), eco-design, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Around 8-10 years of experience in digital design&lt;/strong&gt;, gained within complex, international product environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record in direct management&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally leading hybrid profiles (designers, engineers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, with a demonstrated ability to influence, advise, and align senior stakeholders (Directors, business teams, tech, and product).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding and strong awareness of current digital design challenges&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly regarding Artificial Intelligence (AI) and eco-design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both written and spoken French and English is required&lt;/strong&gt; to thrive in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence without authority&lt;/strong&gt; — Build trust, inspire teams with a forward-looking vision, and rally decentralized designers, product managers, and engineering leaders around shared standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Work closely with diverse domains (Omni, Supply Chain, Sports, Core Platforms), listening to their specific operational realities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Foster an open, generous craft culture where teams share work early, learn from failures, and help each other grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — Stay curious and grounded, proactively developing yourself and others while turning challenges into positive learning moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The CoE might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love enabling other designers and seeing teams succeed thanks to your support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy both direct team management and leading a wider community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited about the future of design and passionate about demystifying AI into practical, human-centered practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like bringing clarity to complex environments and building simple, scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in elevating design excellence across Decathlon Digital!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work locations: Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille or Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality gear: Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global reach: A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill development: Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation package: Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Ready to shape the future of talent acquisition in a global trading firm? As a Senior Campus Recruiter, you&#39;ll be the driving force behind spotting and bringing the top 1% of talent from Europe&#39;s premier universities on board. Your journey involves navigating the full campus recruitment lifecycle, from identification to selection, and making your mark at European recruitment events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join our Campus Recruitment team in Europe, based in Amsterdam, part of a wider recruitment organisation of experienced tech, trading and business support recruiters. Collaboration comes first here: we share knowledge, step in for each other in peak season, and succeed as one team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end recruitment process: screening, interviewing, assessment review, offer conversations and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with business leaders and interviewers, and make sure we&#39;re aligned on hiring needs and on what great looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a data-driven way, using insights to make our process sharper, fairer and more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to strategic projects such as market analyses, process and assessment reviews, and improvements to how we select&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IMC at recruitment events across Europe, with frequent travel (more than four times a year)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of industry experience, ideally within a global finance, trading, tech or consultancy organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of financial markets and the trading industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical eye: you question how things are done, spot trends early and turn them into practical improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to think strategically and act tactically, moving easily between the bigger picture and getting things done today&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solution-oriented mindset: when something isn&#39;t working, you look for a better way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy operational recruitment. Running a tight process and giving candidates a great experience energises you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build relationships with the business with ease and earn trust as a partner, not just a service provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a dynamic environment where no two days are the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well in a larger team and put collaboration first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You keep up with industry trends and best practices in campus recruitment and bring them into your own work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A unique work culture that values collaboration, initiative, and ownership. Our professional and friendly environment provides the perfect backdrop for your growth and responsibilities. We operate with transparency in a flat structure, allowing you direct engagement with stakeholders and professionals. Your input matters here, contributing to our collective success. At IMC, continuous learning is a priority. Various training and on-the-job growth opportunities allow you to shape your path within the organisation. This isn&#39;t just a job; it&#39;s a journey of ongoing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We appreciate your efforts. Our highly competitive salary comes with great perks. If you&#39;re looking for a friendly yet professional space to contribute and grow, IMC is the place. If you&#39;re ready for a role beyond routine recruitment, where your experience can contribute to the future of our team and company, apply now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We started a movement in which everyone can win – shoppers, retailers, society and every person on our team. To play fair, trust people and reward them for doing the right thing. We see and feel the impact of our work as more and more people gain financial freedom and retailers grow across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2014 in Sydney, Australia, Afterpay has over 24 million active customers globally and more than 250,000 of the best retailers around the world including&amp;nbsp; DSW, Finish Line, Levi’s, Primark, and M&amp;amp;S,and many others.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Afterpay, and now Clearpay in the UK, are helping people spend responsibly! We empower customers to access the things they want and need, while still allowing them to maintain financial wellness and control, by splitting payments in four, for both online and in-store purchases. Clearpay is deeply committed to delivering positive outcomes for customers. Now under the Block ecosystem, we are focused on supporting our community of shoppers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We trust in the next generation and share a vision of a more accessible and sustainable world in which people are rewarded for doing the right thing. Join a movement in which everyone can win.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Head of Mid Market and Enterprise Sales, you will join a successful dynamic team. We are looking for a passionate, and committed outbound Account Executive to engage and sell Clearpay to Mid Market merchants across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outbound prospect via email and phone to generate new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the entire sales funnel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate conversations with senior executives and business owners at target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong pipeline of opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the metrics and key value propositions that will drive mutually beneficial contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly demonstrate our USP&#39;s over and above our competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close long term contracts that benefit both Clearpay and our partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable to your target and demonstrate control of your opportunities through pipeline management and CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use defined sales methodology to progress opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal stakeholders from sales leadership to marketing through to finance to define contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full cycle sales and closing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering or exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can demonstrate success in a 360 sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of selling at senior executive level and above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working with e-commerce, payments, fintech or retail verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A level of formal sales and negotiation training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about people, business, and can inspire this passion in others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in seeking out and implementing feedback, and dedication to the improvement of your craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tenacity and an ability to adapt to new situations quickly and think on your feet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills that help you connect with customers by email and phone to establish trust and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to drive deals independently in a fast-paced, dynamic environment Business development experience (e.g. hunting and cold calling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and team player mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Salesforce experience or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
