&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to translate central architectural guidance into actionable operational practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborative, a problem-solver, and a confident communicator capable of driving consensus among diverse teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
